+
+    // CUSTOM (F-236): worgen human form (Two Forms). A look = 16 bytes: 0 skin, 1 face, 2 hair style, 3 hair colour,
+    // 4 facial hair, 5-8 UNIT_FIELD_PADDING bytes (eye, face marking, body marking, scars), 9 jewellery, 10-15 geoset
